{"id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-consistency-statement.md","title":"Consistency Statement","display":"df-consistency-statement — Consistency Statement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-consistency-statement","aliases":["90-df-consistency-statement","90-df-con"],"display":"df-consistency-statement — Consistency Statement","depends_on":["[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-godel-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-consistency-statement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-consistency-statement</span><span>90-df-con</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-statement — Consistency Statement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-consistency-statement-—-Consistency-Statement-$\\mathrm{Con}_T$\">df-consistency-statement — Consistency Statement <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 的定义域是全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；其定义只使用有限推导，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 可有效公理化或选有证明编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 的式子另固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 的同一完整证明呈示，满足该文件关于签名、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span>、有效公理化、行验证器和所选证明公式的全部条件。数码和标准结构见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 在下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5e705f7962c302c2\" href=\"?note=5e705f7962c302c2\" title=\"90-df-godel-number\">90-df-godel-number</a> 的同一固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的有限推导。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bot&amp;\\coloneqq(0=S(0)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow U\\nvdash\\bot\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,g(\\bot)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_T&amp;:=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\bot)}),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\mathrm{Con}_T&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\bot&amp;\\coloneqq(0=S(0)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow U\\nvdash\\bot\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{ProofCode}_T(p,g(\\bot)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_T&amp;:=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\bot)}),\\\\\n\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\mathrm{Con}_T&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 及矛盾句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=1\">\\(0=1\\)</span> 的调用约定。前者由定义足以排除任何一对相反定理（爆炸律会推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=1\">\\(0=1\\)</span>）。反过来，要把“不证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=1\">\\(0=1\\)</span>”与通常句法一致性完全等同，必须有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash0\\ne1\">\\(T\\vdash0\\ne1\\)</span>，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span>；任意不含算术分离公理的理论不能省略此条件。最后的标准模型等价只使用已证明的真实证明码对应及所选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 的正确性，不意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 内部证明自己的可靠性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-consistency-statement-—-Consistency-Statement-$\\mathrm{Con}_T$","text":"df-consistency-statement — Consistency Statement $\\mathrm{Con}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce